                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewolembe ma pi Turo. Wugoi nduru, wu combo mi Tarcic; kum judwoke ni uvuru, ketho nia ot umbe, mondo mbe: kud i ng’om Kitim enyuthre igi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubed ling’, wu ju m’ubedo dhu nam, in ma jukuloka mi Sidon, m’ukadhu ku wi nam, gipong’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kodhi mi Cihor ma ni wi pi ma dit, mwoka ini Nil, en e giralima pare; man en e katali mi thek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lewic unegi, E Sidon; kum nam uweco, ka ma tek mi nam, uwacu kumae, Remokum umbe kuda, kadi anyol ungo, kadi awo’oi de atungo ngo, kadi nyir de atungo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde ma rwonglembe wok i Misiri, can binegogi dit kum rwonglembe mi Turo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wukadh lokacaba Tarcic; wugoi nduru, wu ju m’ubedo dhu wath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni adhura mu mi mutoro, ma bedo pare ma con en e mi nindo ma con, ma tiende tere bor ni umondo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga’ m’ukeco maeni kum Turo, ma jami jamkermiwic, ma jukulokane gi judongomawijo, ma jukuloka pare gi weg yung m’i ng’omi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mir udul ukeco maeni, kara ucid kuhaya mi dwong’ ceke, kara ukel weg yung m’i ng’om ceke i cac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadh kud i ng’om peri calu Nil, E Nyatarcic; gin m’ucero mbe kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erieyo cinge wi nam, eyengo ker: Yehova mio lembang’ola pi Kanan, kara unyoth ka ma tekne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Anyong’a binegi kendo ngo, E in i Nyasidoni ma sumba ma jusendo: ai, kadh lokaca ba Kitim; cil kuca ibibedo ku yom ungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, ng’om mi Jukasidi: dhanu maeni mbe kendo; Jaascuri ukethe ni yedi mi langa; giting’o odkur migi malu; giredho udi mi kerne: gidwoke ni uvuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wugoi nduru, wu combo mi Tarcic; kum ka ma tek mu judwoko ni uvuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia wijo biwil kum Turo rundi pier abiro, calku nindo p’ubimo acel: yo ng’ei rundi pier abiro Turo biwero calu won asara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gam adungu, lwor adhura, in i won asara ma wijo wil piri; tim badwal ma mit, wer wer dupa, kara jupoi piri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre yo ng’ei rundi pier abiro, nia Yehova biliewo Turo, e ebidwogo ba sukulia pare, man ebitimo tarwang’ ku ker ceke m’i ng’om wi wang’ ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kuloka pare ku sukulia pare bibedo leng’ ni Yehova: jubigwoke ngo kadi jubikane de ngo: kum kuloka pare bibedo ni ju m’ubedo i wang’ Yehova, kara gicam m’uromo, man mi kendi ma nindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
